window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Life surrounds Dorian Ironstrike, but he’s been alone so long he doesn’t know how to feel anymore. Dragged from the depths of the King’s Dungeon, his sentence is suspended for him to lead a mission to explore and colonize in the farthest reaches of Zirad. But with inexperienced dwarfs and dangers lurking deep beneath them the hardest struggle will be keeping them alive. Disgraced by his past actions, could this be his chance to reunite with his family and make his life whole again?</p>"; 
